  "task_html": "<div style='background:#eff6ff;border:1.5px solid #bfdbfe;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin:10px 0;'><p style='font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin:0;'>L&ouml;se die vier Gleichungssysteme mit dem Einsetzungsverfahren. Die Einsetzen-Schritte sind vorgegeben &ndash; trage die fehlenden Werte ein.</p></div><div style='background:#eff6ff;border:1.5px solid #bfdbfe;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin:10px 0 6px;'><p style='font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 2px;color:#1e3a8a;'>Aufgabe A</p><p style='font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin:0;'>(I)&nbsp;y = x&minus;1 &nbsp;&nbsp; (II)&nbsp;3x+y = 11</p></div><div style='font-size:13px;padding:2px 0 8px;'><div style='display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin:6px 0;'><span style='background:#d97706;color:white;border-radius:50%;min-width:20px;height:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;'>1</span><span>Einsetzen: &nbsp; 3x + <span style='background:#fef3c7;color:#d97706;font-weight:700;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;'>(x&minus;1)</span> = 11 &nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp; vereinfacht: 4x &minus; 1 = 11</span></div><div style='display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin:6px 0;'><span style='background:#2563eb;color:white;border-radius:50%;min-width:20px;height:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;'>2</span><span>Isolieren: &nbsp; 4x = <input class='cell-input' style='width:55px;display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;' data-ans='12' placeholder='?'></span></div><div style='display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin:6px 0;'><span style='background:#2563eb;color:white;border-radius:50%;min-width:20px;height:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;'>3</span><span>x = <input class='cell-input' style='width:55px;display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;' data-ans='3' placeholder='?'></span></div><div style='display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin:6px 0;'><span style='background:#2563eb;color:white;border-radius:50%;min-width:20px;height:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;'>4</span><span>y = x&minus;1 = <input class='cell-input' style='width:55px;display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;' data-ans='2' placeholder='?'></span></div></div><div style='background:#eff6ff;border:1.5px solid #bfdbfe;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin:14px 0 6px;'><p style='font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 2px;color:#1e3a8a;'>Aufgabe B</p><p style='font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin:0;'>(I)&nbsp;y = 2x&minus;3 &nbsp;&nbsp; (II)&nbsp;x+y = 12</p></div><div style='font-size:13px;padding:2px 0 8px;'><div style='display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin:6px 0;'><span style='background:#d97706;color:white;border-radius:50%;min-width:20px;height:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;'>1</span><span>Einsetzen: &nbsp; x + <span style='background:#fef3c7;color:#d97706;font-weight:700;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;'>(2x&minus;3)</span> = 12 &nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp; vereinfacht: 3x &minus; 3 = 12</span></div><div style='display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin:6px 0;'><span style='background:#2563eb;color:white;border-radius:50%;min-width:20px;height:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;'>2</span><span>Isolieren: &nbsp; 3x = <input class='cell-input' style='width:55px;display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;' data-ans='15' placeholder='?'></span></div><div style='display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin:6px 0;'><span style='background:#2563eb;color:white;border-radius:50%;min-width:20px;height:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;'>3</span><span>x = <input class='cell-input' style='width:55px;display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;' data-ans='5' placeholder='?'></span></div><div style='display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin:6px 0;'><span style='background:#2563eb;color:white;border-radius:50%;min-width:20px;height:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;'>4</span><span>y = 2x&minus;3 = <input class='cell-input' style='width:55px;display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;' data-ans='7' placeholder='?'></span></div></div><div style='background:#eff6ff;border:1.5px solid #bfdbfe;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin:14px 0 6px;'><p style='font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 2px;color:#1e3a8a;'>Aufgabe C</p><p style='font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin:0;'>(I)&nbsp;y = x+4 &nbsp;&nbsp; (II)&nbsp;2x+y = 16</p></div><div style='font-size:13px;padding:2px 0 8px;'><div style='display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin:6px 0;'><span style='background:#d97706;color:white;border-radius:50%;min-width:20px;height:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;'>1</span><span>Einsetzen: &nbsp; 2x + <span style='background:#fef3c7;color:#d97706;font-weight:700;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;'>(x+4)</span> = 16 &nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp; vereinfacht: 3x + 4 = 16</span></div><div style='display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin:6px 0;'><span style='background:#2563eb;color:white;border-radius:50%;min-width:20px;height:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;'>2</span><span>Isolieren: &nbsp; 3x = <input class='cell-input' style='width:55px;display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;' data-ans='12' placeholder='?'></span></div><div style='display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin:6px 0;'><span style='background:#2563eb;color:white;border-radius:50%;min-width:20px;height:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;'>3</span><span>x = <input class='cell-input' style='width:55px;display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;' data-ans='4' placeholder='?'></span></div><div style='display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin:6px 0;'><span style='background:#2563eb;color:white;border-radius:50%;min-width:20px;height:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;'>4</span><span>y = x+4 = <input class='cell-input' style='width:55px;display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;' data-ans='8' placeholder='?'></span></div></div><div style='background:#eff6ff;border:1.5px solid #bfdbfe;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin:14px 0 6px;'><p style='font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 2px;color:#1e3a8a;'>Aufgabe D</p><p style='font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin:0;'>(I)&nbsp;y = 3x+1 &nbsp;&nbsp; (II)&nbsp;x+y = 9</p></div><div style='font-size:13px;padding:2px 0 8px;'><div style='display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin:6px 0;'><span style='background:#d97706;color:white;border-radius:50%;min-width:20px;height:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;'>1</span><span>Einsetzen: &nbsp; x + <span style='background:#fef3c7;color:#d97706;font-weight:700;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;'>(3x+1)</span> = 9 &nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp; vereinfacht: 4x + 1 = 9</span></div><div style='display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin:6px 0;'><span style='background:#2563eb;color:white;border-radius:50%;min-width:20px;height:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;'>2</span><span>Isolieren: &nbsp; 4x = <input class='cell-input' style='width:55px;display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;' data-ans='8' placeholder='?'></span></div><div style='display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin:6px 0;'><span style='background:#2563eb;color:white;border-radius:50%;min-width:20px;height:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;'>3</span><span>x = <input class='cell-input' style='width:55px;display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;' data-ans='2' placeholder='?'></span></div><div style='display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin:6px 0;'><span style='background:#2563eb;color:white;border-radius:50%;min-width:20px;height:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;flex-shrink:0;'>4</span><span>y = 3x+1 = <input class='cell-input' style='width:55px;display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;' data-ans='7' placeholder='?'></span></div></div><div class='check-bar'><button class='btn-check' onclick='checkStation(7)'>&#x2713; &Uuml;berpr&uuml;fen</button><button class='btn-reset' onclick='resetStation(7)'>&#x21BA; Zur&uuml;cksetzen</button><span class='check-result' id='check-result-7'></span></div>",
  "sol_html": "<p style='font-size:14px;line-height:2;'><strong>A:</strong> &nbsp; 4x&minus;1=11 &rarr; 4x=<strong>12</strong> &rarr; x=<strong>3</strong>, y=3&minus;1=<strong>2</strong> &nbsp; &check; (3|2)<br><strong>B:</strong> &nbsp; 3x&minus;3=12 &rarr; 3x=<strong>15</strong> &rarr; x=<strong>5</strong>, y=2&middot;5&minus;3=<strong>7</strong> &nbsp; &check; (5|7)<br><strong>C:</strong> &nbsp; 3x+4=16 &rarr; 3x=<strong>12</strong> &rarr; x=<strong>4</strong>, y=4+4=<strong>8</strong> &nbsp; &check; (4|8)<br><strong>D:</strong> &nbsp; 4x+1=9 &rarr; 4x=<strong>8</strong> &rarr; x=<strong>2</strong>, y=3&middot;2+1=<strong>7</strong> &nbsp; &check; (2|7)</p>",
